#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:4
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:6
msgid ""
"This guide will help you get LMCache up and running quickly within 2 "
"minutes. You'll see LMCache in action with a complete end-to-end example."
msgstr ""
"本指南将帮助您在2分钟内快速启动和运行LMCache。"
"您将通过一个完整的端到端示例看到LMCache的实际运行效果。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:9
msgid "(Terminal 1) Install LMCache"
msgstr "（终端1）安装LMCache"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:11
msgid "First, install LMCache with these three commands:"
msgstr "首先，使用以下三个命令安装LMCache："

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:19
msgid "Start vLLM with LMCache using a single command:"
msgstr "使用单个命令启动带有LMCache的vLLM："

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:30
msgid ""
"If you want to customize configurations further, you can create a "
"configuration file. See the :doc:`../api_reference/configurations` page "
"to learn about all available options."
msgstr ""
"如果您想进一步自定义配置，可以创建一个配置文件。"
"请查看 :doc:`../api_reference/configurations` 页面了解所有可用的选项。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:33
msgid "(Terminal 2) Test LMCache in Action"
msgstr "（终端2）测试LMCache的实际运行"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:35
msgid ""
"Now let's see LMCache working! Open a new terminal and send your first "
"request:"
msgstr ""
"现在让我们看看LMCache的运行效果！打开一个新的终端并发送您的第一个请求："

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:48
msgid "You should see LMCache logs like this:"
msgstr "您应该看到类似这样的LMCache日志："

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:54
msgid ""
"**What this means:** The 27 tokens from your prompt are being stored in "
"CPU RAM because this is the first time the system processes this text. "
"LMCache is caching the KV cache for future reuse."
msgstr ""
"**这意味着：** 您提示中的27个token被存储在CPU RAM中，"
"因为这是系统第一次处理这段文本。LMCache正在缓存KV缓存以供将来重用。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:56
msgid "Now send a second request with a prefix that overlaps with the first:"
msgstr "现在发送第二个请求，其前缀与第一个请求重叠："

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:69
msgid "You should see logs like this:"
msgstr "您应该看到类似这样的日志："

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:78
msgid "**What this means:**"
msgstr "**这意味着：**"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:80
msgid "**Total tokens 32**: The new prompt has 32 tokens after tokenization"
msgstr "**总token数32**：新提示在token化后有32个token"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:81
msgid ""
"**LMCache hit tokens: 24**: 24 tokens were found in the cache (24 is a "
"multiple of 8, our chunk size in this example)"
msgstr ""
"**LMCache命中token数：24**：在缓存中找到了24个token（24是8的倍数，在这个示例中8是我们的块大小）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:82
msgid ""
"**Need to load: 8**: vLLM has automatic prefix caching enabled with block"
" size 16. Although there are 24 hit tokens, 16 are already in GPU RAM "
"managed by vLLM, so LMCache only needs to load 24-16=8 tokens"
msgstr ""
"**需要加载：8**：vLLM启用了自动前缀缓存，块大小为16。虽然有24个命中token，"
"但其中16个已经在vLLM管理的GPU RAM中，所以LMCache只需要加载24-16=8个token"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:83
msgid ""
"**Why 24 hit tokens instead of 27?** LMCache hashes every 8 tokens "
"incrementally (8, 16, 24, 27). When the new request comes in, it checks "
"every 8-token chunk, so it uses the 24-token hash instead of checking the"
" 27-token hash"
msgstr ""
"**为什么是24个命中token而不是27个？** LMCache每8个token递增地进行哈希"
"（8、16、24、27）。当新请求到来时，它检查每个8-token块，所以它使用24-token哈希而不是检查27-token哈希"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:84
msgid ""
"**Stored another 8 tokens**: The new 8 tokens form a complete chunk that "
"gets hashed and stored in CPU RAM for future use"
msgstr ""
"**存储了另外8个token**：新的8个token形成一个完整的块，被哈希并存储在CPU RAM中供将来使用"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:86
msgid ""
"🎉 **Congratulations!** You've just seen LMCache automatically cache and "
"reuse KV caches, reducing computation for overlapping text."
msgstr ""
"🎉 **恭喜！** 您刚刚看到LMCache自动缓存和重用KV缓存，减少了重叠文本的计算量。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:89
msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:91
msgid ""
"**Performance Testing**: Try the :doc:`benchmarking` section to "
"experience LMCache's performance benefits with more comprehensive "
"examples"
msgstr ""
"**性能测试**：尝试 :doc:`benchmarking` 部分，通过更全面的示例体验LMCache的性能优势"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart.rst:92
msgid ""
"**More Examples**: Explore the :doc:`quickstart/index` section for "
"detailed examples including KV cache sharing across instances and "
"disaggregated prefill"
msgstr ""
"**更多示例**：探索 :doc:`quickstart/index` 部分，查看详细示例，包括跨实例的KV缓存共享和分离式预填充"

